https://youtu.be/Ynuu7XQQ2-8?si=-N2JaXd_wLJwRjtZ', '{"en":"This easy loop route ascends to El Negrell (1,345m) from the vicinity of Mas del Ric de Fredes. The trailhead is accessible via a forest track from Fredes, suitable for all types of vehicles. Due to forestry work, parking might be slightly further along at the junction leading to Refugio de la Font Ferrera.\n\nThe trail primarily follows forest tracks and small, well-marked paths, indicated by yellow markers on information posts. It covers 9.6km with 383m of elevation gain, making it a relatively short and straightforward hike suitable for most fitness levels. El Negrell summit features a geodesic vertex.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil ascendeix a l''Negrell (1.345m) des de les proximitats del Mas del Ric de Fredes. L''inici del sender és accessible per una pista forestal des de Fredes, apta per a tot tipus de vehicles. A causa de treballs forestals, l''aparcament podria estar una mica més endavant, a la cruïlla que va al Refugi de la Font Ferrera.\n\nEl recorregut segueix principalment pistes forestals i petits senders ben marcats, indicats amb xapes grogues als pals d''informació. Cobreix 9,6km amb 383m de desnivell positiu, sent una caminada relativament curta i senzilla, apta per a la majoria de nivells de forma física. El cim de l''Negrell compta amb un vèrtex geodèsic.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil asciende a El Negrell (1.345m) desde las proximidades del Mas del Ric de Fredes. El inicio del sendero es accesible por una pista forestal desde Fredes, apta para todo tipo de vehículos. Debido a trabajos forestales, el aparcamiento podría estar un poco más adelante, en el cruce que va al Refugio de la Font Ferrera.\n\nEl recorrido sigue principalmente pistas forestales y pequeños senderos bien marcados, indicados con chapas amarillas en los postes de información. Cubre 9,6km con 383m de desnivel positivo, siendo una caminata relativamente corta y sencilla, apta para la mayoría de niveles de forma física. La cumbre de El Negrell cuenta con un vértice geodésico."}'::jsonb, 'nandomoneda', 9640, 383, 383, 1324, 1169, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 12000, 999, '2024-02-16', '2024-01', '[{"lat":40.726073,"lng":0.184203,"ele":1179.2},{"lat":40.726074,"lng":0.184203,"ele":1179.2},{"lat":40.726077,"lng":0.184207,"ele":1179.3},{"lat":40.72608,"lng":0.184224,"ele":1179.4},{"lat":40.726091,"lng":0.184225,"ele":1179.4},{"lat":40.726069,"lng":0.184209,"ele":1179.3},{"lat":40.726035,"lng":0.184215,"ele":1179.3},{"lat":40.726024,"lng":0.184217,"ele":1179.4},{"lat":40.725971,"lng":0.184263,"ele":1179.6},{"lat":40.725943,"lng":0.184279,"ele":1179.7},{"lat":40.72598,"lng":0.184331,"ele":1180},{"lat":40.726011,"lng":0.184342,"ele":1180.1},{"lat":40.726041,"lng":0.184414,"ele":1180.5},{"lat":40.726052,"lng":0.184436,"ele":1180.6},{"lat":40.726059,"lng":0.184448,"ele":1180.7},{"lat":40.726123,"lng":0.184544,"ele":1181.3},{"lat":40.7262,"lng":0.184675,"ele":1182.3},{"lat":40.72624,"lng":0.184741,"ele":1182.8},{"lat":40.726268,"lng":0.184794,"ele":1183.3},{"lat":40.726311,"lng":0.184887,"ele":1184},{"lat":40.726355,"lng":0.184991,"ele":1184.8},{"lat":40.726391,"lng":0.185102,"ele":1185.6},{"lat":40.72641,"lng":0.185204,"ele":1186.3},{"lat":40.726439,"lng":0.18533,"ele":1187.2},{"lat":40.726473,"lng":0.185496,"ele":1188.4},{"lat":40.7265,"lng":0.185626,"ele":1189.2},{"lat":40.726531,"lng":0.185753,"ele":1190},{"lat":40.72655,"lng":0.185881,"ele":1190.7},{"lat":40.726568,"lng":0.186007,"ele":1191.4},{"lat":40.726586,"lng":0.18608,"ele":1191.7},{"lat":40.726597,"lng":0.186151,"ele":1191.9},{"lat":40.72661,"lng":0.186222,"ele":1192.2},{"lat":40.726622,"lng":0.186377,"ele":1192.7},{"lat":40.726628,"lng":0.186547,"ele":1193.3},{"lat":40.726635,"lng":0.186682,"ele":1193.8},{"lat":40.72664,"lng":0.186821,"ele":1194.3},{"lat":40.726637,"lng":0.187038,"ele":1195.1},{"lat":40.72664,"lng":0.187155,"ele":1195.5},{"lat":40.726673,"lng":0.187359,"ele":1196.6},{"lat":40.726696,"lng":0.187456,"ele":1197.3},{"la