,"ele":110.6},{"lat":41.032217,"lng":0.579417,"ele":111.9},{"lat":41.032344,"lng":0.579375,"ele":112.9},{"lat":41.03279,"lng":0.579336,"ele":117.3},{"lat":41.032948,"lng":0.579268,"ele":118.1},{"lat":41.033174,"lng":0.579126,"ele":119.8},{"lat":41.033326,"lng":0.579082,"ele":121.4},{"lat":41.033399,"lng":0.579079,"ele":122.4},{"lat":41.033506,"lng":0.579119,"ele":123.3},{"lat":41.033575,"lng":0.579184,"ele":124.2},{"lat":41.033834,"lng":0.579252,"ele":125.9},{"lat":41.034209,"lng":0.579394,"ele":127.7},{"lat":41.034213,"lng":0.579467,"ele":128.7}]'::jsonb),
('wikiloc', '16448418', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/andorra-pic-descobes-2-781-m-100-cims-16448418', 'Andorra - Pic d''Escobes 2,781 m - 100 peaks', '{"en":"Incles Valley via Pont de la Baladosa","ca":"Vall d''Incles pel Pont de la Baladosa","es":"Valle de Incles por el Puente de la Baladosa"}'::jsonb, 'Andorra - Pic d''Escobes 2.781 m - 100 cims Hiking trail in Incles, Canillo (Andorra). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ascensió al Pic d''Escobes sortint del Pont de la Baladosa a la vall d''Incles. Atractiva ruta per la vall de Juclar i aeri itinerari que s''enfila de manera impressionant fins al Pic d''Escobes. Pocs metres abans del cim haurem de grimpar uns passos de III grau però sense massa dificultats ni sensació de vertigen. 
 
Hora Inici: 09/29/2016 08:57Hora Fi: 09/29/2016 18:40Distància recorreguda: 14,3 km (09:42)Temps en moviment: 04:28Velocitat mitjana: 1,48 km/hVel. en Mov.: 3,2 km/hVelocitat Màxima: 7,72km/hAltura Mínima: 1835 mAltura Màxima: 2773 mVelocitat d''Ascens: 284 m/hVelocitat de Descens: -242,7 m/hGuany d''altitud: 1105 mPèrdua d''altitud: -1136 mTemps d''Ascens: 03:53Temps de Descens: 04:40', '{"en":"This moderate 14.3 km loop to Pic d''Escobes starts from Pont de la Baladosa in Vall d''Incles. The route offers an attractive journey through the Juclar valley, followed by an exposed ascent that climbs impressively towards Pic d''Escobes.\n\nNear the summit, hikers will encounter some scrambling sections of grade III, which are manageable without excessive difficulty or significant exposure. The total elevation gain is 999 m, making it a rewarding day hike for those comfortable with light scrambling.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 14,3 km al Pic d''Escobes comença des del Pont de la Baladosa a la vall d''Incles. La ruta ofereix un atractiu recorregut per la vall de Juclar, seguit d''un itinerari aeri que s''enfila de manera impressionant cap al Pic d''Escobes.\n\nPocs metres abans del cim, els excursionistes trobaran alguns passos de grimpada de grau III, que són gestionables sense excessiva dificultat ni sensació de vertigen. El desnivell acumulat és de 999 m, convertint-la en una excursió d''un dia gratificant per a aquells acostumats a la grimpada lleugera.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 14,3 km al Pic d''Escobes comienza desde el Pont de la Baladosa en el valle de Incles. La ruta ofrece un atractivo recorrido por el valle de Juclar, seguido de un itinerario aéreo que se eleva de manera impresionante hacia el Pic d''Escobes.\n\nPocos metros antes de la cima, los excursionistas encontrarán algunos pasos de trepada de grado III, que son manejables sin excesiva dificultad ni sensación de vértigo. El desnivel total es de 999 m, lo que la convierte en una gratificante caminata de un día para aquellos cómodos con la trepada ligera."}'::jsonb, 'Imperdibles', 14275, 999, 999, 2763, 1836, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 34920, 2531, '2017-02-16', '2016-08', '[{"lat":42.601962,"lng":1.687755,"ele":1836},{"lat":42.601875,"lng":1.687758,"ele":1836.2},{"lat":42.601845,"lng":1.687813,"ele":1836.5},{"lat":42.60182,"lng":1.687868,"ele":1836.9},{"lat":42.601792,"lng":1.687927,"ele":1837.4},{"lat":42.601768,"lng":1.687995,"ele":1837.9},{"lat":42.601738,"lng":1.68805,"ele":1838.5},{"lat":42.601722,"lng":1.688108,"ele":1839},{"lat":42.601697,"lng":1.688167,"ele":1839.6},{"lat":42.601655,"lng":1.688203,"ele":1840.2},{"lat":42.601622,"lng":1.688257,"ele":1841},{"lat":42.6016,"lng":1.688313,"ele":1841.8},{"lat":42.601593,"lng":1.688375,"ele":1842.3},{"lat":42.601583,"lng":1.688443,"ele":1843},{"lat":42.601585,"lng":1.688523,"ele":1843.5},{"lat":42.601585,"lng":1.688595,"ele":1843.9},{"lat":42.601588,"lng":1.688658,"ele":1844.3},{"lat":42.601585,"lng":1.688727,"ele":1844.9},{"lat":42.601568,"lng":1.688785,"ele":1845.7},{"lat":42.601553,"lng":1.688855,"ele":1846.6},{"lat":42.601533,"lng":1.68891,"ele":1847.5},{"lat":42.601535,"lng":1.688982,"ele":1848},{"lat":42.60153,"lng":1.689048,"ele":1848.6},{"lat":42.60153,"lng":1.689115,"ele":1849.1},{"lat":42.601542,"lng":1.689182,"ele":1849.2},{"lat":42.601537,"lng":1.689248,"ele":1849.9},{"lat":42.601532,"lng":1.689317,"ele":1850.7},{"lat":42.601532,"lng":1.689382,"ele":1851.3},{"lat":42.60154,"lng":1.689445,"ele":1851.6},{"lat":42.601545,"lng":1.689512,"ele":1852.1},{"lat":42.60155,"lng":1.689577,"ele":1852.6},{"lat":42.601568,"lng":1.689638,"ele":1852.6},{"lat":42.60159,"lng":1.689693,"ele":1852.4},{"lat":42.601613,"lng":1.689752,"ele":1852.1},{"lat":42.60163,"lng":1.689812,"ele":1852},{"lat":42.601627,"lng":1.689877,"ele":1852.5},{"lat":42.601597,"lng":1.689932,"ele":1854},{"lat":42.601567,"lng":1.689983,"ele":1855.5},{"lat":42.60154,"lng":1.690047,"ele":1856.7},{"lat":42.601513,"lng":1.690108,"ele