-“Cap de Pla Redon per Dólmen Cobertrada, Pla Sarri, Salt dels Gossos, Bordes d’Ares i Camí d’Andorra desde Noves de Segre” 
ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-senderisme/cap-de-pla-redon-per-dolmen-cobertrada-pla-sarri-salt-dels-gossos-bordes-dares-i-cami-dandorra-desd-136051010', '{"en":"This loop route starts from Noves de Segre, parking by the road connecting to Argestues. It follows old paths, linking the villages and churches of Noves de Segre, Argestues, and Berén before ascending to Mount Sant Quiri (1499m) and its 11th-century hermitage, offering panoramic views of the Segre valley.\n\nThe descent traces part of the Vertical Quiri race route, following the steep and scenic Roques Roges ridge. The trail is 14.9 km long with 884m of elevation gain, making it a good option for hikers seeking a quiet, varied day out on well-established paths.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular comença a Noves de Segre, amb aparcament a la carretera que connecta amb Argestues. Segueix antics camins, enllaçant els pobles i esglésies de Noves de Segre, Argestues i Berén abans de pujar a la Muntanya de Sant Quiri (1499m) i la seva ermita de l''s. XI, oferint vistes panoràmiques de la vall del Segre.\n\nLa baixada recorre part del traçat de la cursa Vertical Quiri, seguint la carena costeruda i escènica de les Roques Roges. El sender té 14,9 km de longitud amb 884m de desnivell positiu, sent una bona opció per a excursionistes que busquen una jornada tranquil·la i variada per camins ben definits.","es":"Esta ruta circular comienza en Noves de Segre, con aparcamiento junto a la carretera que conecta con Argestues. Sigue antiguos caminos, enlazando los pueblos e iglesias de Noves de Segre, Argestues y Berén antes de ascender a la Montaña de Sant Quiri (1499m) y su ermita del siglo XI, ofreciendo vistas panorámicas del valle del Segre.\n\nEl descenso recorre parte del trazado de la carrera Vertical Quiri, siguiendo la empinada y escénica cresta de las Roques Roges. El sendero tiene 14,9 km de longitud con 884m de desnivel positivo, siendo una buena opción para excursionistas que buscan una jornada tranquila y variada por caminos bien establecidos."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 14919, 884, 884, 1497, 639, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 24900, 1436, '2017-04-24', '2017-03', '[{"lat":42.294819,"lng":1.343442,"ele":639.9},{"lat":42.294818,"lng":1.343437,"ele":640.1},{"lat":42.294781,"lng":1.343457,"ele":640.1},{"lat":42.294628,"lng":1.343568,"ele":639.7},{"lat":42.294623,"lng":1.343519,"ele":640.5},{"lat":42.294455,"lng":1.342846,"ele":650.3},{"lat":42.294413,"lng":1.342651,"ele":653},{"lat":42.294399,"lng":1.342576,"ele":654.3},{"lat":42.294504,"lng":1.342492,"ele":655.2},{"lat":42.294555,"lng":1.342479,"ele":655.5},{"lat":42.294839,"lng":1.342349,"ele":657.6},{"lat":42.294889,"lng":1.342308,"ele":658.4},{"lat":42.295029,"lng":1.342257,"ele":658.9},{"lat":42.295095,"lng":1.342226,"ele":659.2},{"lat":42.295228,"lng":1.342175,"ele":659.9},{"lat":42.295415,"lng":1.342036,"ele":662.9},{"lat":42.295516,"lng":1.34198,"ele":663.5},{"lat":42.295505,"lng":1.341952,"ele":664.3},{"lat":42.295448,"lng":1.341956,"ele":664.8},{"lat":42.295425,"lng":1.341934,"ele":665.9},{"lat":42.295526,"lng":1.341864,"ele":667.8},{"lat":42.295635,"lng":1.34177,"ele":669.6},{"lat":42.29565,"lng":1.34175,"ele":670},{"lat":42.295692,"lng":1.341683,"ele":671.5},{"lat":42.29576,"lng":1.34164,"ele":671.3},{"lat":42.29586,"lng":1.341543,"ele":673.1},{"lat":42.295885,"lng":1.341522,"ele":673.5},{"lat":42.295984,"lng":1.341401,"ele":676.1},{"lat":42.296012,"lng":1.341374,"ele":676.5},{"lat":42.296139,"lng":1.341232,"ele":679},{"lat":42.296239,"lng":1.341142,"ele":680},{"lat":42.296305,"lng":1.341077,"ele":680.9},{"lat":42.296435,"lng":1.340966,"ele":681.9},{"lat":42.29647,"lng":1.340948,"ele":681.7},{"lat":42.296613,"lng":1.340771,"ele":684.9},{"lat":42.296625,"lng":1.340756,"ele":685.1},{"lat":42.29673,"lng":1.340605,"ele":687.7},{"lat":42.296739,"lng":1.340597,"ele":687.7},{"lat":42.296775,"lng":1.340574,"ele":687.6},{"lat":42.296853,"lng":1.340508,"ele":687.8},{"lat":42.297035,"lng":1.340322,"ele":688.2},{"lat":42.297045,"lng":1.340312,"el